### The one rule to remember

If you remember nothing else, remember:

```text
Multiple readers:
&T + &T + &T     ✅

One writer:
&mut T           ✅

Readers + writer:
&T + &mut T      ❌
```

Once **references + ownership + borrowing** click, a huge part of Rust starts making sense.